        given-names: Baptiste
    journal: Nature Microbiology
    year: 2024
    notes: >-
      Source of the interaction matrix, strain and phage metadata, defense
      system calls, and the core-genome and VIRIDIC trees.
  - type: software
    title: AntiDefenseFinder survey of anti-defense systems in RefSeq phages
    authors:
